  "lore": {
    "description": "A spectral green mist that gathers into the vague impression of a grinning skull trailing a ghost-like tail for a body, the Ectoghoul was among the forms the Phantiri Generator produced once the Leviticus Overdrive taught it to make life the moon-weapon could not read as living, a body the killing signal ignores, drifting where organic laborers dropped dead on the spot. Nothing now issues it orders. It zips across the tarry oceans and splayed forests of the mass grave, passing through surfaces, disappearing and re-appearing at will, and amuses itself instead by terrorizing other Xalians, announcing every arrival with a cackle and answering any challenge with a blast of gooey ectoplasm.",
